      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand that if we use the CONSOLE_READ_NEXT option, we should not issue SNAPSHOT anymore.\nIf we don\u0027t issue EC_CMD_CONSOLE_READ fast enough, not only we will lose data overwritten in the buffer, but if we wrap around we will lose all the buffer.\nShouldn\u0027t we update tx_snapshot_head when we write past it?",
